{"4834280": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Toimkonna simulator", "steam_appid": 4834280, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Toimkonna Simulator is a first-person survival horror and management simulation game set in a military environment. Your duties are: keep the soldiers safe, watch cameras, maintain order, and ensure every room is cleaned before nightfall. Survive before the time hits 6 AM.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before you want to start in the army you have to complete your night shifts. You have to show that you don't break any rules and don't fall asleep at your job. If you complete them, then you can start the real army experience. But first, you have to complete your first task to show that you are a real soldier. There will be many sleepless nights, yes, but it will be worth your sacrifice!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What to do here?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have to make sure no one is breaking the rules and that everybody follows them. This is a very strict place where you don't want to break any rules. Breaking them will not end well. Good luck, soldier, and complete your night shifts to become better on the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What to do if someone breaks the rules</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the toughest place on Earth. If someone breaks the rules, then you can punish them by hitting them or in other ways</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Power up Items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leg Combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watching Cameras</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cleaning</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And Much More!</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Toimkonna Simulator is a first-person survival horror and management simulation game set in a military environment. Your duties are: keep the soldiers safe, watch cameras, maintain order, and ensure every room is cleaned before nightfall. Survive before the time hits 6 AM.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before you want to start in the army you have to complete your night shifts. You have to show that you don't break any rules and don't fall asleep at your job. If you complete them, then you can start the real army experience. But first, you have to complete your first task to show that you are a real soldier. There will be many sleepless nights, yes, but it will be worth your sacrifice!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What to do here?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have to make sure no one is breaking the rules and that everybody follows them. This is a very strict place where you don't want to break any rules. Breaking them will not end well. Good luck, soldier, and complete your night shifts to become better on the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What to do if someone breaks the rules</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the toughest place on Earth. If someone breaks the rules, then you can punish them by hitting them or in other ways</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Power up Items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leg Combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watching Cameras</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cleaning</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And Much More!</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Toimkonna Simulator is a first-person survival horror and management simulation game 